# CRT Align needs NO environment variables.
#
# The browser app (web/) is a static site with no backend: files are processed
# locally in the browser. Its only network requests are public CDN loads
# (mediabunny from cdn.jsdelivr.net, fonts from Google Fonts). The Python CLI and
# the bench scripts are offline. No API keys, tokens or secrets of any kind.
# This file exists only to document that; there is nothing to copy to a .env file.
